- op: discuss  # 8a7e
  at: '2026-03-21T06:28:17Z'  # 8a7e
  by: agent  # 8a7e
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 8a7e
  clock: 4  # 8a7e
  nonce: 8a7e  # 8a7e
  message: "Current implementation (PR #2470) is correct: call edges left unannotated for graceful degradation, assignment/return/borrow edges annotated with directional access_mode. The directional call-site annotation idea would be a future enhancement but isn't needed for correct slicing. Flagging for human review to decide if this is worth pursuing or can be closed as wont_do."  # 8a7e
- op: discuss  # 2fa9
  at: '2026-03-23T08:53:19Z'  # 2fa9
  by: human  # 2fa9
